AI startup Grantd, which recently acquired the venerable Excel-based StockOpter equity compensation planning tool, has launched its equity compensation advice platform, aimed at helping advisors manage clients equity compensation, such as stock options, RSUs, ISOs and ESPPs.

Equity compensation represents a $4 trillion market across public and private companies, Grantd stated.&nbsp;

